            "source": [
                "# Explainable Multimodal Deception Analysis System - Demo with Synthetic Data\n",
                "\n",
                "This notebook demonstrates the full pipeline for detecting deception using **synthetic data** when real datasets are unavailable. The system generates realistic facial, audio, and cross-modal features based on research findings about deception indicators.\n",
                "\n",
                "## Key Features Demonstrated:\n",
                "1. **Synthetic Data Generation**: Create realistic deception/truthful feature data\n",
                "2. **Model Training**: Train a deception classifier on synthetic data\n",
                "3. **Full Pipeline Analysis**: Run the complete multimodal analysis pipeline\n",
                "4. **Evaluation**: Cross-validation, ablation studies, and performance metrics\n",
                "5. **Explainability**: SHAP-based feature importance and behavioral interpretations"
            ]
        },
        {
            "cell_type": "markdown",
            "metadata": {},
            "source": [
